# Vertex 3 = (2,0,3) projects into the relative interior of edge 0, which runs
# along y=0 at z=0. The two edges meeting at that vertex therefore each end on
# another edge's interior.
note = a vertex projects into the interior of a non-incident segment
knot = unknot
vertex_on_edge       == 2
max_point_multiplicity == 3
multiple_points      >= 1
spatial              == 0
